  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-54\">\n    <header class=\"article-header\">\n        <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 54</h2>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"article-content\">\n        <div class=\"article-text\">\n            <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n                <p>L'article 130 du même arrêté est complété par un alinéa rédigé comme suit :</p>\n                <p>\"Les intermédiaires financiers qui assurent la commercialisation des parts de l'organisme de placement collectif en Belgique ne peuvent pas prélever de commissions ou frais autres que ceux visés à l'article 60, § 1er,</p>\n                <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n                        <span class=\"provision-text\">et</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\">\n                        <span class=\"provision-text\"></span>\n                    </li>\n                </ol>\n                <p>, § 2,</p>\n                <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n                        <span class=\"provision-text\">et</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\">\n                        <span class=\"provision-text\"></span>\n                    </li>\n                </ol>\n                <p>, et § 3,</p>\n                <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n                        <span class=\"provision-text\">.</span>\n                    </li>\n                </ol>\n                <p>\"</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</article>",
